 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "For that + conjunctive",
   "texto": [
    "When the subject changes, use **para que** + conjunctive: **Vou ligar-te cedo, para que tenhas tempo** (I'll call you early for time).",
    "There is also **a fim de que** (so that), more formal: **a fim de que possamos decidir** (so that we can decide)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "For + infinitive",
   "texto": [
    "With the same subject, use **para** + infinitive: **Estudo para passar no exame** (study to pass the test). If the subject changes, in addition to **para que** + conjunctive, it is possible to use the flexed infinitive: **Falei baixo para as crianças não acordarem** (I spoke low so that the children would not wake up).",
    "Don't use **para que passe** if you're the one studying."
   ]
